{"name":"Sarshel","status":"ok","title":"Sarshel","pageId":37807,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\">\n\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Sarshel</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup id=\"cite_ref-FR9-p29_1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FR9-p29-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-IA_2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-IA-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"alt spelling\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Alt. spelling</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Sarshal</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aliases\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Songhal</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">City</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Impiltur\" title=\"Impiltur\">Impiltur</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Unapproachable_East\" title=\"Unapproachable East\">Unapproachable East</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Northeast_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"Northeast Faerûn\">northeast Faerûn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History<sup id=\"cite_ref-FR9-p29_1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FR9-p29-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6,000&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1359_DR\" title=\"1359 DR\">1359&#160;DR</a><br>18,000&#160;in <a href=\"/wiki/1347_DR\" title=\"1347 DR\">1347&#160;DR</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Sarshel\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Sarshel\">Inhabitants of  Sarshel</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Sarshel\" class=\"newcategory\" title=\"Category:Locations in Sarshel\">Locations in  Sarshel</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Sarshel (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2F0ZWdvcnk6T3JnYW5pemF0aW9uc19pbl9TYXJzaGVsP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Organizations in  Sarshel</span></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Sarshel</b>, sometimes called <b>Songhal</b>,<sup id=\"cite_ref-IA_2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-IA-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> was a walled port city of <a href=\"/wiki/Impiltur\" title=\"Impiltur\">Impiltur</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FR9-p29_1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FR9-p29-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> In the decades following the <a href=\"/wiki/Spellplague\" title=\"Spellplague\">Spellplague</a>, it was better known as <a href=\"/wiki/New_Sarshel\" title=\"New Sarshel\">New Sarshel</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-FRCG-p88_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG-p88-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> As of the turn of the 16<sup>th</sup> century <a href=\"/wiki/DR\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>, it was once again known as Sarshel.<sup id=\"cite_ref-HoF-p61_4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-HoF-p61-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Locations\">Notable Locations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Sarshel?veaction=edit&section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Notable Locations\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Marhymbel_House_Shipways\" title=\"Marhymbel House Shipways\">Marhymbel House Shipways</a>, one of the fastest ship-builders in the <a href=\"/wiki/Sea_of_Fallen_Stars\" title=\"Sea of Fallen Stars\">Sea of Fallen Stars</a>, led by brothers <a href=\"/wiki/Ilund_Marhymbel\" title=\"Ilund Marhymbel\">Ilund</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Vromur_Marhymbel\" title=\"Vromur Marhymbel\">Vromur Marhymbel</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/1490_DR\" title=\"1490 DR\">1490s</a> <a href=\"/wiki/DR\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-tev-ships_5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-tev-ships-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Sarshel?veaction=edit&section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"metadata plainlinks stub\"><tbody><tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"></span></td>\n<td><i>This Realmslore article about a geographical location is a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:stub\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Wikipedia:stub\">stub</a>.  You can help the Forgotten Realms Wiki by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Sarshel?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</i></td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Sarshel?veaction=edit&section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-FR9-p29-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FR9-p29_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FR9-p29_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FR9-p29_1-2\">1.2</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/R.A._Salvatore\" title=\"R.A. Salvatore\">R.A. Salvatore</a>&#160;(1989). <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Bloodstone_Lands_(sourcebook)\" title=\"The Bloodstone Lands (sourcebook)\">The Bloodstone Lands</a></i>. Edited by <a href=\"/wiki/Elizabeth_T._Danforth\" title=\"Eliz